<title>UK: BOE allots 495 mln stg in repo, bills.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 495 mln stg in repo, bills.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it allotted 495 million stg in 6.0 percent repos to March 24 and 25 and outright bills maturing on or before March 25.</p>
<p>This comprised 363 million stg in repo and 132 million in bills.</p>
<p>This brought total liquidity provided to the market to 1.225 billion stg compared with the Bank's initial shortage forecast of 1.2 billion.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
